NOTE — this licence covers the SOURCE CODE only.

The data this code processes carries separate terms, and they are not MIT:

  * Flight trajectories: © adsb.lol contributors, Open Database Licence
    (ODbL) v1.0 — https://www.adsb.lol/docs/open-data/historical/
    The published site and reports are a "Produced Work" under ODbL, which
    requires attribution to adsb.lol and identification of the ODbL licence
    of the source database. Redistributing a derivative DATABASE (for
    example, the aggregated per-route tables as a downloadable dataset)
    would additionally require that database to be released under ODbL.

  * Airports: OurAirports, public domain (CC0).

  * Wind: ERA5 / ERA5T, Copernicus Climate Change Service (C3S) — subject
    to the Copernicus licence, which requires attribution.

  * Aircraft performance model: OpenAP (TU Delft), open source, cited in
    the methodology.

  * ICAO Carbon Emissions Calculator methodology v13.1, used to anchor the
    per-type reference fuel flows; the derived values in
    data/anchored_cruise_ff.json are a conversion of published ICAO figures.

See DATA-LICENCE.md for what each of these permits in practice.
